      summary: 'Card points in tricks: Gstieß, Trock 21, Trock 1, Kings 5 each; Queens 4; Cavaliers 3; Jacks 2; others 1. Total 70. Normal games: bidder needs 36+ (plus at least one trick). Count in threes, subtract 2 per group; remainder subtract 1. Special games (Ulti, Piccolo, Bettel, Räuber) have fixed scores.',
